# Bundled runtime binaries (ffmpeg, yt-dlp) - too large for GitHub (< 100 MB limit: ffmpeg.exe
# alone is ~145 MB). Everything else under extraResources/ (the small native RPC libraries,
# under 1 MB each) is meant to be committed normally - this used to ignore the whole
# extraResources/ folder, which silently excluded those too (that's why libdiscord-rpc.so never
# showed up in `git status` even though it was sitting right there on disk).
# To build a self-contained distribution, place ffmpeg/yt-dlp in:
# composeApp/src/desktopMain/extraResources/common/bin/ffmpeg.exe
# composeApp/src/desktopMain/extraResources/common/bin/yt-dlp.exe
composeApp/src/desktopMain/extraResources/common/bin/ffmpeg.exe
composeApp/src/desktopMain/extraResources/common/bin/yt-dlp.exe
